            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "KASUE"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I don't think this really tastes like a root beer float -- the vanilla flavor isn't strong enough -- but it IS a yummy drink! Be sure to use cold root beer!",
            "datePublished": "2010-05-28T13:47:41.710Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "SEY1"
            },
            "reviewBody": "These are so much fun to make! Learn from my mistake, though, and keep some paper towel handy to clean up the rootbeer that shoots out of the tumbler when you drop the shotglass in. They really do taste like rootbeer floats. Perfect for summer parties!",
            "datePublished": "2008-04-15T13:48:57.243Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "erinella"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Was very good! Made it for some friends at a party. Make sure you only do 4oz of root beer because the carbonation makes it hard to chug! I will definitly be making this again.",
            "datePublished": "2008-02-22T10:11:47.013Z"
